  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Clean Desk, Doodle Margins",
    "overview": "The page is the loudest thing on screen. Controls are calm and legible; personality lives in the margins: a hand-drawn squiggle marking where you are, hand-lettered titles, and Bituin in a corner, never over the work.",
